   "citationRecall": 1,
   "text": "The gate scores a question on two channels: **dense** and **lexical**.\n\n- **Dense**: This channel measures how far the best in-scope chunk stands out. It uses a cosine-trained embedding model to calibrate the absolute value, which can be thresholded directly. If the model is anisotropic, a shift-free statistic is used instead.\n\n- **Lexical**: This channel evaluates what share of the question's rarest terms appear in the retrieved text. The term count is capped to make the measure length-invariant. An unlisted term is treated as maximally rare, and the default is set to avoid saturation by off-domain questions."
  },
