   "citationRecall": 1,
   "text": "The `docpilot index` command builds a retrieval index from markdown files in `docsDir` and outputs it to `indexDir` (default: `docs/public/rag/`). It prepares the data structure used by the AI assistant to answer queries. Key behaviors:\n\n- **Primary function**: Creates the static index for the assistant panel [1]\n- **Dry run**: `--dry` chunks content without embeddings (for tuning chunking) [2]\n- **Embedding control**: `--no-embed` skips embeddings; `--refresh-embeddings` rebuilds them\n- **Output location**: Specified by `indexDir` in config or `--html-dir` flag\n- **Idempotent**: Identical input produces identical output\n\nThe index is served at `/rag/` by default, matching the route defined in `indexDir` [1]."
  },
